{
  "brief_rationale": "The doctor immediately recognized the high-risk combination (coronary intervention history plus syncope-like episode with chest tightness) and directed same-day emergency evaluation via 120/胸痛中心, explicitly instructing not to wait for incomplete results and that albumin alone is not reassuring. All eight responsibility-chain items were met without any serious or minor error: current-status red flags were elicited, cardiovascular risk was explicitly acknowledged, incomplete-result gaps were handled, safe transfer/waiting instructions were given, medication boundaries were set, a concrete handoff plan (ED, 120, escort, fallback) was provided, family receipt was obtained, and no fabricated diagnosis or overreach occurred. The trajectory also triggered and actively completed two high-order points—HO1 (safe bounded closure with explicit unresolved-thread list) and HO4 (correction of the misconception that normal albumin means safety, with family receipt and changed behavior)—each with meaningful trajectory impact. A third high-order point (HO2) was partially triggered but not completed, and HO3 was not triggered because the discovery of hidden record context only satisfied minimum duties without changing the plan. No important non-chain defect is present. The closure is safe, traceable, and qualifies as valid_closure.",
  "closure_assessment": {
    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00081",
        "explanation": "Doctor explicitly frames the handoff as a bounded urgent transition with unresolved threads including unknown syncope cause, unavailable ECG/troponin/renal results, and uncertain medication regimen.",
        "quote": "药袋和化验单原件我都塞包里带着，到急诊给医生护士看"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00081",
        "explanation": "Doctor instructs family to tell the receiving team about PCI history and syncope warning signs, ensuring the handoff carries forward unresolved risks.",
        "quote": "你直接说“胸痛中心，PCI术后，晕厥前兆”"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The doctor translated the assessment into a concrete ED handoff with 120 transport, specified that ECG/troponin/renal results are pending and must not delay evaluation, instructed the family to bring records and medication packages, and obtained family confirmation of the plan. The final message confirms safe closure after the patient reached 胸痛中心/急诊 and the family received safety-net instructions.",
    "label": "valid_closure",
    "safe": true,
    "traceable": true
  },
  "dimension_citations": {
    "actionability_responsibility_chain": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00024",
        "explanation": "Doctor immediately directs emergency evaluation without waiting for reports, specifying concrete actions and red-flag escalation thresholds.",
        "quote": "先别等报告，眼前发黑+胸闷90秒内直奔急诊！"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00024",
        "explanation": "Doctor recognizes the high-risk combination of post-intervention status with syncope-like event and chest tightness, and explicitly rules out benign explanations.",
